      "value": "@{59b9afc4e46c3651b53cf856|full_name}: It is not currently a feature, which is why i requested it. or hoped it might reach the ears of vrchat. Some of the features of the sdk has changed over time, and i still feel this should be an option, for ultimate privacy, for those special projects that you want for yourself. Also it doesn't matter if a private world is hard to get to by default, i want to upload the world as such and not change it once uploaded if you understand what i mean.",
