  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-05-16T16:25:43.376Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If it is not mentioned, id like to propose a setting for uploading a new world that makes this world unavailable to everyone except the creator, for those extremely personal and private worlds you may wan't to create. This is something id like to have, and i think more control over how the world gets uploaded would be nice. Also this lets creators control the flow off people into new worlds while they are testing them online, food for thought. Maybe a tag to add if you plan to have this world public in the future.",
